6. Write an SQL query to display:
The country and the number of players from each country (use alias PLAYER_COUNT).


select country , count(player_id) as PLAYER_COUNT 
from players group by country ;


7. Write an SQL query to display:
Order ID, User ID, Payment Status, and Total Price for all orders where the payment status is Pending.

select order_id , user_id , payment_status, total_price from
orders where payment_status = "Pending";


8. Write an SQL query to display:
Each user type and the total number of users of that type.


select user_type , count(user_id) from users 
group by user_type;


9. Write an SQL query to display:
Movie name and channel name for movies whose rights type is Linear Pay TV.

select c.name , m.title from movie m join movielicense ml
on ml.movieid = m.movieid join channel c on 
c.channelid = ml.channelid where ml.rightstype = "Linear Pay TV";


10. write an SQL query to display:
The visitor's name, ticket type, enclosure's name, and enclosure's type for
all visitors whose ticket type is not Child and whose enclosure type is not Arctic.


select v.name , v.ticket_type , e.name , e.type from
visitor v join enclosure_visit_log ev on 
  ev.visitor_id = v.visitor_id join enclosure e on 
e.enclosure_id = ev.enclosure_id where v.ticket_type != "Child"
and e.type != "Arctic";


11. Write an SQL query to display:
Airing ID, Episode ID, and Channel Name for episodes that air after 6:00 PM.

select a.airingid , a.episodeid , c.name from airing a join 
channel1 c on c.channelid = a.channelid where 
time(a.starttime) > time('18:00:00') and a.episodeid is not null;


12. Write an SQL query to display:
Order ID, User ID, and the date for all orders placed on January 3, 2025.

select order_id , user_id , placed_at from orders1 
where DATE(placed_at) = '2025-01-03';


13. Write an SQL query to display:

Title of the movie and its duration in hours where the right to air
for the movie is Free-to-Air.
Hint: Duration in hours = (durationmin) / 60

select m.title , round((m.durationmin)/60,2) as duration from movie m 
join movielicense ml on m.movieid = ml.movieid
where ml.rightstype = "Free-to-Air";


